# --- Local artifacts ---
# The data dictionary is regeneratable (FR-012); keep it committed for the
# baseline so reviewers can read it without running the pipeline. Uncomment
# to ignore it if you prefer to regenerate on demand.
# data_dictionary.md

# --- Metabase local state cache (feature 004) ---
# `metabase setup` writes the latest known state (admin email, db_id,
# collection_id, version) here for idempotency. Regeneratable via the CLI.
.artifacts/metabase_state.json
